<title>USA: Riddell completes Varsity tender.</title>
<headline>Riddell completes Varsity tender.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Riddell Sports Inc said Thursday it has completed its cash tender offer for Varsity Spirit Corp at $18.90 per share.</p>
<p>The company said it financed the offer with proceeds of its $115 million sale of 10.5 percent senior notes due 2007.</p>
<p>Riddell said that based on a preliminary count, about 98.6 percent of Varsity's common stock, or about 4.5 million shares, were tendered. The remaining shares, said Varsity, will be subsequently acquired at the same price.</p>
<p>The merger is expected to occur on or about July 25.</p>
<p>Riddell sells sporting goods products and services. Varsity Spirit supplies cheerleader and dance team uniforms and operates cheerleading and dance team camps.</p>
</text>
